`/* Regional settings follow;` contains "region" only as part of a longer
word, so it opens nothing and cannot hide the orphan `/* endregion;`
below it: region_end_mismatch fires (diag.region_end_mismatch second
Flags fence).
-- input.ssl --
/* Regional settings follow;
:DECLARE sLocale;
sLocale := "en-US";
/* endregion;
